    "Counts are successful harness case executions, not unique cases, instructions, tensor elements, or exhaustive format combinations.",
    "The selected-index runs add 24 repeated case executions: WMMA 20 exact + 2 modeled + 1 selected random, and FEDP 1 selected generated case.",
    "Independent exact means expected fixtures are independent of TfrFedp; NaN payload/sign and signed zero remain governed by the numerical comparison policy.",
    "FEDP generated tests mix pseudorandom operands and directed feature/boundary patterns; they are not all independent uniform-random tests.",
    "ULP=0 applies to floating-point comparisons; integer cases use exact 32-bit modular equality. NaNs compare by class, signed zeros compare equal, and infinities require matching sign.",
